---
description: Drizzle ORM migration workflow
globs: ["apps/web/src/db/**/*", "apps/web/drizzle/**/*"]
alwaysApply: false
---
# Drizzle Migrations

- Edit schema in `src/db/schema`.
- Generate migrations with `pnpm db:generate`.
- Apply migrations with `pnpm db:migrate`.
- Do not hand-edit generated SQL migrations.
